 "EFFECT_FLOOR": "NOT_PROVED",
 "EFFECT_FLOOR_REASON": "The floor does what it says \u2014 it removes rank-HIGHER calls that rest on very few positive sites \u2014 and on this sample it removes exactly the pathology it was built for. What is NOT proved is that it discriminates signal from noise. 3 of the 71 floor values tried give the identical partition, so the number 5 is not selected by the data. On this sample it is reproduced to within 0 cells by a plain incidence threshold of 0.41, which means it is selecting severity and not a count of sites. It makes a HIGHER call arithmetically impossible in 142 of 282 classified cells. It is absent from the module's own parameter list, from the emitted PARAMS block and from the sensitivity grid, so gate F has never varied it. And 8 of the 9 withheld cells are the highest value ever recorded at that window in that province."
}